      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Are you local to Maghull?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. We're at 29 Park Road, Kirkby, L32 2AL. Kirkby is the next postcode south of Maghull. Many of our customers are within 4 miles of our base. The other plumbers ranking for emergency plumber Maghull are based further away or run national call centres." } },
