        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Sefton Suburban Specialists</h3><p>Maghull is in Sefton, not Liverpool. We know the council, the wards (Molyneux, Park, Sudell), the Neighbourhood Plan and the local planning rules.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Our Own Gas Safe Engineers</h3><p>Every engineer is our own staff. No sub-contractors. No agency workers. Check our entry at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>Fixed Rates. No Surprises.</h3><p>£80 weekdays. £120 weekends. £150 out of hours. 1 hour minimum. Parts at cost. Written quote first.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>System Boiler and Cylinder Skills</h3><p>Maghull homes still use system boilers and hot water cylinders more than most areas. We're G3 qualified for unvented work. Plenty of plumbers aren't.</p></div>
        <div class="pf-why-item"><h3>12-Month Workmanship Guarantee</h3><p>Every repair carries a 12-month workmanship guarantee. If something we fixed fails because of our work, we come back. No charge.</p></div>
